{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe45b0cd7915f9f347aeb419b7a4b32f3bc29627c15c7a7a39b8b2113000ba4b", "ja": "（ジュリアが出場した野外ロックフェスは、\nとんでもない盛り上がりを見せた！）", "zh": "（茱莉亚参加的户外摇滚音乐节，现场气氛热烈得不得了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3f61a0d4e6037659c7fb2ceee5dc1c6ece2baaabab2883a220a2549175ec9161", "ja": "（今は、祭りの後の静けさ。俺はプレゼントボックスの\n中身を渡すため、ジュリアを探している……）", "zh": "（现在是热闹过后的寂静。我正在寻找茱莉亚，好把礼物盒里的东西交给她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bbe3b6f043ca5053ee3a3276203e4f04bdfd5efebabd41f614f37bc7bd0f7fd2", "ja": "あ、いたいた！　ジュリア、お疲れさま。\nこれ、渡しておくぞ…………ん？　ジュリア、おーい？", "zh": "啊，找到你了！茱莉亚，辛苦了。\n这个先给你…………嗯？茱莉亚，喂——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "01b3c9b1616907e1cf5515e25811f3f5c0390a28f8bf292a885eb8ba049ffd25", "ja": "っと……ああ、{$P$}か。\n悪い、ちょっとボーッとしてた。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "等等……啊，是{$P$}啊。\n抱歉，刚才有点发呆。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1005_p", "source_sha256": "443c370eecef28a00019dacfe49d32137d5bb04261fee7196343a6cbc3cc7ea7", "ja": "ファンレターとか、プレゼントを渡そうと思って。\nほら、結構あるぞ……よいしょっと。", "zh": "我想把粉丝来信什么的，还有礼物交给你。\n你看，还挺多的……嘿咻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "aedd3ab30e5bad995e0afb8cfe575494db5b9c9b45f8729faf356a12bf26195f", "ja": "お、サンキュ！\nこういうのって、ホントありがたいよな～。", "zh": "哦，谢谢！\n这种东西，真的很让人感激啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6f661247704696afc2846e5ce618f24dd629b18c59493187854f3d9de5b384bb", "ja": "そうだな。ところで、ボーッとしてたって\nどうしたんだ？　フェスで疲れたとか？", "zh": "是啊。不过话说回来，你刚才怎么在发呆？难道是因为音乐节累着了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "13d9f1c847d1790afe8c8c07bdff0fb1c8da818f0eae9504eb0ace7812048b8b", "ja": "へへっ、あたしはそんなにヤワじゃないっての！\nただ……ちょっと、バンドの事を思い出してたんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我才没那么脆弱呢！\n只是……刚才稍微想起了乐队的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "fe6d9b5c0eb591118c9b062fba87bd62395a5db9e559931ad975b2343f4e6e49", "ja": "あの頃は、いつかでかいステージに立ってやる！\nって、必死に歌ってたな～、とか。", "zh": "那时候我还拼命唱着，想着总有一天一定要站上大舞台！之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "d73a1b92f349cef6febef852823c6b28b77bc9c1a7aaf1f466a5bfd8c70f190c", "ja": "あんまり聴いてもらえなかったけど、\n今思うと、なんだかんだ充実してたな……とかさ。", "zh": "虽然没多少人听就是了，\n但现在回想起来，总觉得那时候过得挺充实的……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b57175f662337c11af538d2dc5821ed6db3ea2b70795ad33e1666311cb08b8ba", "ja": "そういうことか。\nそのバンド仲間とは、今でも連絡は取っているのか？", "zh": "原来是这样。你和那些乐队伙伴，现在还保持联系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "adcc2f550a1ba61c36a1af0c5e347297e4f98b8ef43dc699b36959befde8dad8", "ja": "いや、まあ、色々あったから……。\n……って、あれ？　このぬいぐるみ……！？", "zh": "没，怎么说呢，发生过不少事……\n……哎等等，奇怪？这个玩偶……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6a64ac1718c1d16e64a3c4140f5f294964f648719ceaa066d5005671f5564a36", "ja": "うん？　ああ、カンガルーのぬいぐるみだな。\nチェックするとき見たけど、結構カワイイよな……。", "zh": "嗯？啊，是袋鼠玩偶啊。\n检查的时候我看到了，挺可爱的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "f1fcf6e3d29b67bc356a338d771a8ef70ba5e49bbc8b36558059f5f2b5b99283", "ja": "……っ！！", "zh": "……っ！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7a2c86327cd8b675928b9e6f755ab7642569ec6f63b75fb35283d53dabd1e30d", "ja": "あっ、おい、ジュリア！？", "zh": "啊，喂，茱莉亚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "c615db6c08d6f27c0b3e38820acf3828ec0b10d6b36a5326db79f1bfc48710bf", "ja": "はぁ、はぁっ……！\nもう帰っちゃったか……ま、そりゃそっか。", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……！\n已经回去了吗……也是，当然了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1017_p", "source_sha256": "82bc9bd4dae80a7f19defeab1c211580770fdf7c76a2a7e11fab221ad5d63cfc", "ja": "お、おーい、ジュリア！　どうしたんだ？\n急に走り出したりして……ハァ、ハァ……！", "zh": "喂、喂——茱莉亚！怎么了？\n突然就跑起来了……呼、呼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "aee4d7ba12d26175e10e891960d0f8105c5d21933ab269835d2b2a0e07a325a6", "ja": "……。\nいや、ちょっとな……あのぬいぐるみのコト。", "zh": "……\n没什么，只是……关于那个毛绒玩偶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "61de0bad96328e896e49c35a6afa15896961f69e1868229fe74663e3f35bb1f3", "ja": "あたしの部屋……い、いや、家にな！\n昔からあるのと、同じヤツなんだよ。", "zh": "在我的房间……不、不对，是家里！\n和那个从很久以前就有的，是同一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fdddb92457a1affa19d861162fa91034d430209bde9926dcbc6a950d054c095a", "ja": "そうなのか。ええと、それはつまり……？", "zh": "是这样吗？呃，也就是说……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "c1563b47e9c089f11268d9f727fa0f004340a73ef7b08b0f4a82e450a7f65c76", "ja": "ははっ！　あいつら、回りくどいコトしやがって。\n来てたなら、顔見せりゃいいのに。", "zh": "哈哈！那帮家伙，净搞些拐弯抹角的事。\n既然来了，露个脸不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1022_p", "source_sha256": "fe014b8bbc75100ecb3bd685d380475f6dc27ced49d2bb1cbe3ea3dde4bd99b0", "ja": "さっき話してたバンド仲間が、\n来てくれてたってことか？　よかったじゃないか！", "zh": "刚才提到的那些乐队伙伴，原来过来支持你了啊？这不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1023_p", "source_sha256": "407e081cd2eb2dada0565ff4a47e7a6a5000a6d89be1580aa2e011f37277a316", "ja": "まだ会場から出てないかもしれないぞ？\n警備員さんに連絡すれば……。", "zh": "说不定还没离开会场呢？\n联系一下保安的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "eab3877d94a16f7f45670e41b91c59eabbf3b918b8d0551fac296a4c48cebd0b", "ja": "いいって！　またチャンスはあるさ。今は、\n来てくれてたってわかっただけで十分だよ……うん。", "zh": "不用啦！反正以后还有机会。现在只要知道\n他们来看过我，这就足够了……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "ef2d5f3624769a578ac75879c8e1f39ab5f1379373ab6c91a069309844b18b0b", "ja": "サンキュ、{$P$}。\nあいつらの気持ち、あたしんトコに持ってきてくれて。", "zh": "谢啦，{$P$}。\n你把那帮人的心意带到我这里来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1026_p", "source_sha256": "0b47b8548cfb284a66563e324d61192ac3ec4d78095ef001ce3a6dbb625d24a2", "ja": "そうか……わかったよ。\nいい仲間だったみたいだな。本当に。", "zh": "这样啊……我明白了。\n看来他们真的是很好的伙伴。真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "9e668ee2110e6962472a80eba482ec4c7965b337783d286b681b04ceba26df3e", "ja": "ああ……なあ、{$P$}。\nあたしはこれからも歌うよ。アイドルとして。", "zh": "啊……对了，{$P$}。\n我今后也会继续歌唱。作为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0224_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "b22af0e7806c95dad8fc22e6c096ec6c5028da6687a592fd9a500ab1c9770c50", "ja": "あいつらに、胸張って会うためにも。だから……。\nこれからもよろしく頼むぜ、{$P$}！", "zh": "为了能昂首挺胸地去见他们。所以……今后也拜托你了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
